    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region leads with $725K in sales, outperforming South by 85%
        • East region generates strong $679K, nearly matching West performance
        • South region significantly underperforms at only $392K in total sales
        • Central region shows moderate performance at $501K

        Recommendations:
        • Focus growth initiatives on South region to close the $333K gap with top performer
        • Analyze West/East best practices for replication in underperforming regions
